  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(5x + 1) : 3 = (x + 3) : 7\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n**a : b = c : d**\n\nor\n\na/b = c/d \n\n⇒ **ad = bc**\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ (5x + 1) : 3 = (x + 3) : 7\n\n⇒ (5x + 1)/3 = (x + 3)/7\n\n⇒ 7(5x + 1) = 3(x + 3)\n\n⇒ 35x + 7 = 3x + 9\n\n⇒ 32x = 2\n\n⇒ x = 1/16\n\n**Hence,**\n\n**The value of x is 1/16.**",
